<title>UK: UK regulator reviewing Reed acquisition.</title>
<headline>UK regulator reviewing Reed acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Director General of Fair Trading on Tuesday said he is considering whether Reed Elsevier's acquisition of Tolley Publishing Co from United News &amp; Media qualifies for merger investigation under the Fair Trading Act 1973.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
